From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:37:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] flatc: Use the C-locale parsers on musl hosts

flatbuffers turns on its locale-independent parsing whenever
_XOPEN_VERSION >= 700, which musl defines, but musl has no strtoll_l or
strtoull_l, so flatc failed to compile for a musl host (the only kind of
host Soong builds on arm64).

Change-Id: I139e71261ad9ac55a5752a930fad78378cd146b2
---
 Android.bp | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index e715631..217d858 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -87,6 +87,13 @@ cc_binary_host {
     exclude_srcs: [
         "src/flathash.cpp",
     ],
+
+    target: {
+        musl: {
+            // musl has no strtoll_l or strtoull_l.
+            cflags: ["-DFLATBUFFERS_LOCALE_INDEPENDENT=0"],
+        },
+    },
 }
 
 java_library {
